;REFINED INITIALLY WITH REFMAC TO AN R OF 23.4 AND RFREE OF 27.9

CONTINUOUS ELECTRON DENSITY FEATURES IN FRONT OF THE INDOLE
RINGS OF TRP84 AND TRP279 DID NOT SATISFACTORILY REFINE
WITH WATER MOLECULES. THESE FEATURES WERE LEFT EMPTY DURING
REFINEMENT, BUT THEIR POSITIONS ARE INDICATED IN THE MODEL
BY OXYGEN ATOMS WITH ZERO OCCUPANCY (RESIDUES 1000 - 1009)
;
